# LFS rules for the HF Space KLEB38/OC_P8 — NOT for GitHub.
#
# Hugging Face stores every file above 10 MB as an LFS object regardless of
# these rules, but git-lfs only runs its smudge filter at checkout for paths
# matched here. Without them the Space's Docker build copies the 134-byte
# pointer text instead of the binary, and the API dies at startup with
# "INVALID_PROTOBUF: Load model from /app/models/model.onnx failed".
#
# The repo's own root .gitattributes is a GitHub linguist config and is
# excluded from the Space upload — see .github/workflows/ci.yml.
*.parquet filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.joblib filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.pkl filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.pt filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.bin filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
models/model.onnx filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
docs/monitoring.gif filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
